+          "source_ids": ["src_002", "src_003", "src_005", "src_016"]
+        },
+        {
+          "text": "The most differentiated pipeline asset is INCA033989, a mutCALR-targeted antibody with early clinical, spleen, anemia, symptom, and molecular-response signals moving toward Phase 3 in ET and MF.",
