+      "summary": "Incyte is not just a discovery-stage biotech: it has multiple commercial products, a deep late-stage pipeline, and technical IP across small molecules, biologics, formulations, and biomarkers. The core question is whether the post-Jakafi pipeline can scale quickly enough to offset the 2028 exclusivity risk.",
